      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duer Juda kɛnɛ tɔ̱a̱ŋdɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ca cueer Juda guaŋ rɛy lɔacdiɛn, ce̱tnikɛ min la jiath a guaŋkɛ, kä ca kɛ kɛ̈t ni rɛy tuɔ̱ŋni yi̱knikiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A cäŋɛ ni gaatkiɛn tiɛmkɛ yi̱knikiɛn kɛnɛ pua̱ny kuɔthdiɛn ni Ä-ce-rim thäri jiɛn diaal tin tɔ̱ɔ̱c, kɛnɛ wuɔ̱th päämni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ pääm tin te piny wec. Ɣän bä ria̱ŋdu kɛɛliw thöp ala pɛ̈c kɛ kui̱ dui̱rädu kɛɛl kɛ gua̱th palädu rɛy ciëŋdu kɛɛliw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ lätku bi duŋdu min cä ka̱m ji̱ bath, kä bä ji̱ jak kä kuany ji̱ tɛ̈ru muun mi kui̱c i̱, kɛ ɣöö ci gakdä jak kä pɛt, kä bɛ pɛ̈t amäni cäŋ kɛl.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋa̱th nath kiɛ Kuoth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pal Yir-mɛ-yaa kɛ kui̱ känä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ti̱et ca̱ŋ lɔ̱ŋä agɔaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ɣä jiök i̱, “Wër cuŋni thok rɛ̈ɛ̈k Nath, min la kua̱r Juda a wä rɛc kɛ jɛ kä bä kɛ raar kɛ jɛ kɛnɛ thuk rɛ̈kni Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm diaal, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä wërɛ i̱, ‘Liɛŋɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial yɛn kua̱r Juda kɛ yɛn ji̱ Juda diaal, kɛ yɛn ji̱ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm diaal tin wä rɛc kɛ kɛn thuk ti̱ti̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Kuoth Nhial nɛmɛ lar ɛn ɣöö tiɛtdɛ tëkdun, /cuarɛ ɣa̱c mi thiɛk kap kɛ cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä, kä /cuarɛ jɛ no̱o̱ŋ rɛc kɛ thuk rɛ̈kni Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /cuarɛ ɣa̱c naŋ raar dho̱rikun kɛ cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä, kä /cuarɛ tekɛ mi la̱tdɛ, duundɛ ɣöö tiɛtdɛ cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä ala cäŋ mi rɛl rɔ, ce̱tnikɛ mëë cä la̱r guurikun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ ŋot /ca jɛ liŋ kä /ken kɛ ji̱thkiɛn pa̱l piny, cu buɔ̱m ni wuɔ̱thkiɛn, /ken kɛ ruac liŋ kä /ken kɛ luek tit.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Mi wä yɛn ɣä wä liŋ, a /ci yɛn ɣa̱c bi nööŋ kɛ kɛn thuk rɛ̈ɛ̈k wec ɛmɛ kɛ cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä, kä bia tit ni cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä ala cäŋ mi rɛl rɔ, kä thilɛ la̱t mi bia la̱t, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bi ben ni kua̱r tin bi nyuur wi̱i̱ kɔam kuäärä Dee-bid kɛ thurbiɛɛli kɛnɛ jiöŋkööri kɛ kɛn thuk rɛ̈ɛ̈k wec ɛmɛ kɛɛl kɛ ruëëckiɛn, kɛ ji̱ Juda kɛnɛ ji̱ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. Kä ɛn wec ɛmɛ ba jɛ ciɛŋ amäni cäŋ kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi naath ben wi̱i̱ni Juda kɛnɛ wi̱i̱ tin thieek kɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kɛnɛ wi̱i̱ ji̱ Ben-ya-min kɛ kui̱ konyä ca̱ŋ thaar pa̱a̱m kɛnɛ wi̱i̱ päämni kɛnɛ Nɛ-gɛb nööŋkɛ muc tin waŋkɛ kɛnɛ luuri, kɛ muc bɛɛl kɛ wal tin kuɔ̱r kuɔ̱ɔ̱r, kä nööŋkɛ muc tɛth kä lɔaac rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö mi /ci yɛn ɣä bi liŋ, a /ci yɛn cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä bi tit ala cäŋ mi rɛl rɔ, kä /ci yɛn ɣa̱a̱c bi nööŋ kɛ kɛn thuk rɛ̈ɛ̈k Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä, mi wä yɛn kɛ wä la̱t, ɣän bä mac jak kä dɔp thukni rɛ̈ɛ̈k, kä bɛ duël Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m pɛt, kä /ca jɛ bi luäŋ kɛ yieny.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
